WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:18.039
Greta was still sobbing.

2
00:00:21.361 --> 00:00:26.184
Ben thought Winnie might start to cry too as she gazed around the gym in dismay.

3
00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:27.885
"Who did this?"

4
00:00:28.306 --> 00:00:29.066
Winnie murmured.

5
00:00:29.086 --> 00:00:31.368
"Why would somebody spill our paint?"

6
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.620
Greta sniffed.

7
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.341
"I bet it was the same monster who drew the mustache on Mr.

8
00:00:37.381 --> 00:00:38.422
Freaky's poster.

9
00:00:38.442 --> 00:00:41.242
That was funny, but this is mean!"

10
00:00:41.262 --> 00:00:45.283
"It is mean," Ben thought.

11
00:00:46.224 --> 00:00:50.345
He remembered that Mog had been with the Doppel Gang when they decorated Mr.

12
00:00:50.445 --> 00:00:52.465
Freaky's poster with a mustache.

13
00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:55.966
Ben hoped Mog wasn't involved in this prank.

14
00:00:58.367 --> 00:00:59.027
"You know what?"

15
00:00:59.487 --> 00:01:00.768
Winnie took a deep breath.

16
00:01:04.482 --> 00:01:05.602
"It doesn't matter who did it.

17
00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:08.945
We have to get the mess cleaned up so we can start painting."

18
00:01:08.965 --> 00:01:12.848
"Right," a witch named Samantha chimed in.

19
00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:14.229
"Let's get to work."

20
00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:17.492
Nodding, Greta wiped her nose.

21
00:01:17.512 --> 00:01:18.913
"I'll see if Mr.

22
00:01:18.973 --> 00:01:20.134
Bog can help us."

23
00:01:22.576 --> 00:01:24.758
She hurried off to get the school janitor.

24
00:01:25.678 --> 00:01:27.100
Winnie turned to Waldo.

25
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:32.384
"Our painting has to be ready for Leonardo da Creepy's visit on Friday night.

26
00:01:33.312 --> 00:01:35.553
Do you think you can make more paints for us tonight?"

27
00:01:35.573 --> 00:01:40.135
"Sure." Waldo was wiping some paint drops from his glasses.

28
00:01:40.155 --> 00:01:42.556
"It should be okay.

29
00:01:42.876 --> 00:01:44.917
I mean, as long as my magic spell works again."

30
00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.679
"Uh-oh," Ben thought.

31
00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:51.781
Waldo's spells rarely worked the way they were supposed to.

32
00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:55.602
A few minutes later, Mr.

33
00:01:55.642 --> 00:01:58.864
Bog arrived with his cart, and everyone began cleaning.

34
00:02:02.716 --> 00:02:05.898
As Ben mopped the floor, he looked around for clues.

35
00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.842
On the far side of the gym, he spotted something.

36
00:02:11.822 --> 00:02:14.824
Tiny droplets of paint were tracked across the floor.

37
00:02:18.267 --> 00:02:20.748
Ben put down the mop and followed the trail.

38
00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:26.672
It led out a rear door of the gym and into the boys' locker room.

39
00:02:29.094 --> 00:02:31.976
Near the row of sinks, the paint trail stopped.

40
00:02:37.036 --> 00:02:38.397
"Huh," Ben murmured.

41
00:02:38.417 --> 00:02:42.758
"Maybe the vandal stopped here to clean paint off himself."

42
00:02:44.879 --> 00:02:48.401
Ben floated around the locker room, looking for more clues.

43
00:02:49.161 --> 00:02:56.164
Nothing. Back in the hallway, he floated around, searching for signs of anything unusual.

44
00:02:58.185 --> 00:03:00.565
As he passed the cafeteria, he halted.

45
00:03:01.206 --> 00:03:06.488
There was something unusual—the three doppelgangers were inside with buckets and sponges.

46
00:03:07.232 --> 00:03:08.673
They were wiping down the tables.

47
00:03:08.693 --> 00:03:11.435
"What are you guys doing?"

48
00:03:11.735 --> 00:03:12.416
Ben called.

49
00:03:13.256 --> 00:03:14.257
Larry moaned.

50
00:03:15.258 --> 00:03:17.039
"We got detention!"

51
00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:21.342
The office ogre stood nearby, her arms folded.

52
00:03:21.362 --> 00:03:24.244
"They drew a mustache on Mr.

53
00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:26.486
Freaky's poster," she snapped.

54
00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:28.587
"I don't care what Ms.

55
00:03:28.647 --> 00:03:31.749
Van Ghoul says—that is not art.

56
00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.132
It is vandalism, pure and simple!"

57
00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.361
"How much longer do we have to clean?"

58
00:03:38.701 --> 00:03:39.742
Carly complained.

59
00:03:39.762 --> 00:03:43.584
"You'll clean until I tell you it's time to stop.

60
00:03:43.984 --> 00:03:44.585
Poor Mr.

61
00:03:44.645 --> 00:03:47.827
Bog had to help with some emergency cleanup in the gym.

62
00:03:48.547 --> 00:03:51.949
I may send you down there to help him after you've finished this!"

63
00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:59.053
Ben noticed that none of the doppelgangers reacted to the office ogre's mention of the gym emergency.

64
00:03:59.073 --> 00:04:02.055
"Hmm," he thought.

65
00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:04.176
"Maybe they didn't spill the paint.

66
00:04:04.988 --> 00:04:06.769
Now, where's Mog?"

67
00:04:09.531 --> 00:04:12.873
A few minutes later, Ben found his friend in the art room.

68
00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:20.619
Several photos were spread out in front of Mog—they were pictures of Monster Academy teachers.

69
00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:26.663
Ben told Mog about the spilled paint, watching his face carefully.

70
00:04:31.446 --> 00:04:32.487
Mog looked upset.

71
00:04:32.507 --> 00:04:34.048
"That's terrible.

72
00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.160
Can I help?"

73
00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:42.103
"I think Winnie and her friends can handle the mess," Ben replied carefully.

74
00:04:42.123 --> 00:04:44.844
"But do you have any idea who might have done it?"

75
00:04:46.505 --> 00:04:48.146
"Nope." Mog shook his head.

76
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:52.907
"I've been in here since classes ended, working on an art project."

77
00:04:54.508 --> 00:04:56.689
He held up a photo of the gym teacher.

78
00:04:57.489 --> 00:05:00.350
He'd drawn a mustache and beard on the teacher's face.

79
00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:05.685
"I call it Gwarg With Goatee," Mog said proudly.

80
00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:11.210
He showed Ben several other pictures with mustaches and beards drawn on them.

81
00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:14.213
"What do you think?"

82
00:05:14.994 --> 00:05:16.014
Ben shook his head.

83
00:05:16.035 --> 00:05:18.877
"Sorry, Mog, but I don't call that art."

84
00:05:19.578 --> 00:05:20.479
"What do you mean?"

85
00:05:20.939 --> 00:05:21.620
Mog said.

86
00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:24.062
"Winnie said I needed inspiration.

87
00:05:25.023 --> 00:05:27.705
I got inspired—by the Doppel Gang's art."

88
00:05:27.725 --> 00:05:30.728
"It's not really art," Ben repeated.

89
00:05:31.212 --> 00:05:34.795
"The Doppel Gang was just making trouble when they drew that mustache on Mr.

90
00:05:34.835 --> 00:05:37.156
Freaky." "Ms.

91
00:05:37.216 --> 00:05:38.918
Van Ghoul said it was art!"

92
00:05:39.318 --> 00:05:40.579
Mog said indignantly.

93
00:05:40.599 --> 00:05:44.642
"I think she just wanted to calm down Mr.

94
00:05:44.702 --> 00:05:47.564
Freaky, so he wouldn't ruin Art Week before it began."

95
00:05:47.584 --> 00:05:51.527
"Well, I like these photos," Mog insisted.

96
00:05:51.547 --> 00:05:53.328
"I'm going to give them to Ms.

97
00:05:53.368 --> 00:05:55.449
Van Ghoul to display for Art Week.

98
00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.772
If she doesn't like them, she doesn't have to use them."

99
00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:05.342
Ben sighed and then floated out of the classroom and back to the gym.

100
00:06:09.263 --> 00:06:12.225
He still had no idea who'd tampered with the magic paints.

101
00:06:13.105 --> 00:06:14.266
But he was a reporter.

102
00:06:14.826 --> 00:06:18.187
So he knew how to keep his eyes and ears open for clues.
